    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike game inspired by <i>Brotato</i>. Perfect for players with limited time who want to skip story-driven content and jump straight into combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The position in which weapons are held grants players unique abilities, total 62 different abilities. Each ability comes with both a buff and a debuff, allowing players to strategically choose the best combination based on the battle and their build.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Weapon</strong>: Choose from 7 unique abilities (from 8 positions: Earth, Water, Fire, Wind, Thunder, Mountain, Marsh, and Heaven, with one default position that triggers no buff or debuff).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Wielding</strong>: Combine weapon positions to unlock up to 55 distinct ability combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Shop System</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers a variety of randomly generated items, weapons, and armor, each with diverse buffs. Combined with weapon position buffs, players can freely mix and match to create unique playstyles, unlocking endless combat possibilities!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike game inspired by <i>Brotato</i>. Perfect for players with limited time who want to skip story-driven content and jump straight into combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The position in which weapons are held grants players unique abilities, total 62 different abilities. Each ability comes with both a buff and a debuff, allowing players to strategically choose the best combination based on the battle and their build.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Weapon</strong>: Choose from 7 unique abilities (from 8 positions: Earth, Water, Fire, Wind, Thunder, Mountain, Marsh, and Heaven, with one default position that triggers no buff or debuff).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Wielding</strong>: Combine weapon positions to unlock up to 55 distinct ability combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Shop System</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers a variety of randomly generated items, weapons, and armor, each with diverse buffs. Combined with weapon position buffs, players can freely mix and match to create unique playstyles, unlocking endless combat possibilities!</p>",
